{"version":1,"content":"<p>前無綫小花「獎老」吳嘉儀（阿七）今年可謂「屋漏兼逢夜雨」，離開電視台後轉型為「街巿天后」，但突然慘遭無預警解僱，唯有再改任KOL，在網上帶貨賺生活費。</p><p>事業一度受挫外，近日再爆婚變，兩夫妻在網上自揭私穩互相數臭，其夫更爆大鑊指她愛飲酒及夜蒲等</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:20.980969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:44:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:41.496392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:41.496392+00:00","content_hash":"5ed3d36d6ec02fe536fcc9bfd521fc48b09b3b8449ae5e2f2f917ce74756a91f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}